    "trackIndexFormula": "songIndex * 12 + layerIndex * 2 + optionOffset. With 6 layers: Song 0 = tracks 0-11, Song 1 = tracks 12-23, Song 2 = tracks 24-35. Option A = even index, Option B = odd index.",
