    "tempos": "Per-layer BPM. Increases each layer to create urgency. Layer 0: 120 BPM (relaxed), Layer 5: 170 BPM (desperate).",
    "auditionBars": "Bars per option per cycle (A and B each get this many bars per cycle). Total voting window = auditionBars * 2 * auditionCycles * barsToMs(1, tempo).",
    "auditionCycles": "Number of A-B cycles per layer. 1 = A then B (default). 2 = A-B-A-B. Each cycle plays option A for auditionBars bars, then option B for auditionBars bars.",
